{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LGXWAbvvRUaHzQBqZ5uFQz","type":"tool_result","content":"1530\t\n1531\t  def test_section_edit_links\n1532\t    raw = <<~RAW\n1533\t      h1. Title\n1534\t\n1535\t      Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit. Maecenas sed libero.\n1536\t\n1537\t      h2. Subtitle with a [[Wiki]] link\n1538\t\n1539\t      h2. Subtitle with *some* _modifiers_\n1540\t\n1541\t      h2. Subtitle with @inline code@\n1542\t\n1543\t      <pre>\n1544\t      some code\n1545\t\n1546\t      h2. heading inside pre\n1547\t\n1548\t      <h2>html heading inside pre</h2>\n1549\t      </pre>\n1550\t\n1551\t      h2. Subtitle after pre tag\n1552\t    RAW\n1553\t    @project = Project.find(1)\n1554\t    set_language_if_valid 'en'\n1555\t    with_settings :text_formatting => 'textile' do\n1556\t      result =\n1557\t        textilizable(\n1558\t          raw,\n1559\t          :edit_section_links =>\n1560\t            {:controller => 'wiki', :action => 'edit',\n1561\t            :project_id => '1', :id => 'Test'}\n1562\t        ).delete(\"\\n\")\n1563\t      # heading that contains inline code\n1564\t      assert_match(\n1565\t        Regexp.new(\n1566\t          '<div class=\"contextual heading-2\" title=\"Edit this section\" id=\"section-4\">' \\\n1567\t          '<a class=\"icon-only icon-edit\" href=\"/projects/1/wiki/Test/edit\\?section=4\">' \\\n1568\t          '<svg class=\"s18 icon-svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"\\/assets\\/icons-.*.svg#icon--edit\"></use></svg>' \\\n1569\t          '<span class=\"icon-label\">Edit this section</span>' \\\n1570\t          '</a></div>' \\\n1571\t          '<a name=\"Subtitle-with-inline-code\"></a>' \\\n1572\t          '<h2 >Subtitle with ' \\\n1573\t          '<code>inline code</code><a href=\"#Subtitle-with-inline-code\" class=\"wiki-anchor\">&para;</a>' \\\n1574\t          '</h2>'\n1575\t        ),\n1576\t        result\n1577\t      )\n1578\t      # last heading\